OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and cloudy this
OL,6,Fmorning. This afternoon will be cloudy
OL,7,Fwith some light and patchy rain
OL,8,Fspreading southeast for a time. Brisk
OL,9,Fwesterly winds at first.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain clearing away this
OL,12,Fevening then dry with clear periods.
OL,13,FThickening cloud will bring some light
OL,14,Fand patchy rain from the west later in
OL,15,Fthe night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FPatchy rain soon clearing.
OL,18,FThen it will be dry with some
OL,19,Fbrightness developing during the
OL,20,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
