OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FAfter
OL,6,Fa mainly dry start scattered showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping by afternoon. Dry on
OL,8,FThursday, rain spreading east later.
OL,9,FEarly rain on Friday, then becoming
OL,10,Fdry.
